      "text": "\u2500\u2500 solid  : association / dependency\n- - dashed: implements / uses\n\u25c7 open    : aggregation\n\u25c6 filled  : composition\n\u25b3 triangle: implements / extends\n\nColors:\n  yellow  = enum\n  blue    = interface / abstract\n  green   = model\n  pink    = strategy\n  orange  = service / singleton\n  purple  = observer",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2500\u2500 solid  : association / dependency\n- - dashed: implements / uses\n\u25c7 open    : aggregation\n\u25c6 filled  : composition\n\u25b3 triangle: implements / extends\n\nColors:\n  yellow  = enum\n  blue    = interface / abstract\n  green   = model\n  pink    = strategy\n  orange  = service / singleton\n  purple  = observer",
